She is a companion-type, so I don't
 think she has that kind of function...

2136
00:03:20,137 --> 00:03:23,307
So it's not just the ship, but the autoreiv is useless as well.

2137
00:03:23,767 --> 00:03:26,767
I'm surprised you could travel this far with them.

2138
00:03:28,857 --> 00:03:29,647
Oh,

2139
00:03:30,147 --> 00:03:32,027
it must be because you're a PROXY.

2140
00:03:32,317 --> 00:03:33,657
Miss Re-l...

2141
00:03:34,027 --> 00:03:38,367
Even though you're a PROXY, you
 don't even know what PROXIES are.

2142
00:03:38,367 --> 00:03:39,287
How ridiculous.

2143
00:03:41,287 --> 00:03:42,367
Dammit...

2144
00:03:42,957 --> 00:03:44,707
When is it going to stop snowing?

2145
00:03:45,997 --> 00:03:49,797
meditation  conceptual blind spot

2146
00:03:45,997 --> 00:03:49,797
meditation  conceptual blind spot

2147
