PROXY...

2148
00:04:16,407 --> 00:04:18,157
If only such things didn't exist...

2149
00:04:20,617 --> 00:04:22,747
Vincent Law...

2150
00:04:28,587 --> 00:04:30,297
That autoreiv is...

2151
00:04:35,927 --> 00:04:37,297
Did she come to get the body back?

2152
00:04:45,597 --> 00:04:46,057
What?

2153
00:04:53,357 --> 00:04:54,947
What have you done?

2154
00:04:55,397 --> 00:04:56,527
You!

2155
00:05:16,837 --> 00:05:18,177
Take it.

2156
00:05:19,007 --> 00:05:21,177
It's just in the way, after all.

2157
00:05:44,197 --> 00:05:45,367
Wait.

2158
00:05:46,617 --> 00:05:49,287
Was it your master?

2159
00:06:07,887 --> 00:06:11,897
Were you looking after that PROXY?

2160
00:06:27,117 --> 00:06:28,327
This is...

2161
00:06:34,297 --> 00:06:35,667
It's the same.

2162
00:06:40,637 --> 00:06:41,797
I see.

2163
00:06:42,137 --> 00:06:43,677
These are all-

2164
00:06:56,027 --> 00:06:57,687
Did that make these?

2165
00:07:00,527 --> 00:07:02,817
What are PROXIES?

2166
00:07:05,027 --> 00:07:07,617
No, that doesn't matter.

2167
00:07:07,617 --> 00:07:09,707
What's important to me right now is...

2168
00:07:17,917 --> 00:07:19,717
What are you going to do?

2169
00:07:20,717 --> 00:07:22,587
You've lost your master...

2170
00:07:30,267 --> 00:07:33,847
Did you think you could steal the
 gun from me while I was sleeping?

2171
00:07:33,847 --> 00:07:36,857
No, um... I thought you might catch cold.

2172
00:07:52,367 --> 00:07:54,077
Do my hair.

2173
00:07:54,537 --> 00:07:56,337
You can do that much, can't you?

2174
00:08:01,217 --> 00:08:02,757
Can't you hear me?

2175
00:08:02,757 --> 00:08:04,967
I'm reading a book.

2176
00:08:06,887 --> 00:08:08,257
What's your problem?

2177
00:08:11,267 --> 00:08:12,637
Then you'll do.

2178
00:08:14,057 --> 00:08:15,597
Do my hair.

2179
00:08:18,267 --> 00:08:19,277
Um...

2180
00:08:19,277 --> 00:08:20,777
Jeez...

2181
00:08:20,777 --> 00:08:22,857
Not having Iggy around is so inconvenient.

2182
00:08:23,277 --> 00:08:24,817
No matter what type of master you have,

2183
00:08:25,607 --> 00:08:27,027
a master is a master.

2184
00:08:28,157 --> 00:08:31,407
Without a master, an Entourage cannot go on living-

2185
00:08:31,867 --> 00:08:34,537
especially me, now that I have a heart.

2186
00:08:35,577 --> 00:08:36,627
So...

2187
00:08:38,587 --> 00:08:40,127
I can only kill-

2188
00:08:41,587 --> 00:08:43,877
kill the one who took my master from me.

2189
00:08:47,047 --> 00:08:48,717
That's right: "Kill."

2190
00:08:49,467 --> 00:08:52,057
If I kill the one who took her, she'll come back to me.

2191
00:08:53,017 --> 00:08:56,097
You'll come back, won't you, Re-l.

2192
00:09:04,607 --> 00:09:06,317
You're pretty good.

2193
00:09:06,317 --> 00:09:07,737
Really?

2194
00:09:10,407 --> 00:09:12,577
I'll ask you from now on.

2195
00:09:12,577 --> 00:09:14,287
Um... where are you going?

2196
00:09:14,287 --> 00:09:15,707
I'm worried about the ship.

2197
00:09:15,707 --> 00:09:17,077
I'll go take a look.

2198
00:09:17,077 --> 00:09:19,287
But outside, the winds...

2199
00:09:22,167 --> 00:09:25,717
If I kill the one who took her, she'll come back to me.

2200
00:09:38,557 --> 00:09:41,437
I'd think it should be able to fly in winds like these.

2201
00:09:41,937 --> 00:09:42,897
Re-l.

2202
00:09:44,817 --> 00:09:45,897
Iggy!

2203
00:09:46,607 --> 00:09:47,947
Why are you here?

2204
00:09:48,407 --> 00:09:50,157
I told you to return to Romdeau!

2205
00:09:51,737 --> 00:09:53,237
I told you, didn't I?

2206
00:09:53,237 --> 00:09:56,707
I said I'd never go anywhere without you.

2207
00:09:57,407 --> 00:09:58,917
You've... been infected with cogito...

2208
00:09:58,917 --> 00:10:00,247
You've... been infected with cogito...

2209
00:10:00,247 --> 00:10:01,667
Oh please, Re-l.

2210
00:10:01,667 --> 00:10:03,417
You're only noticing now?

2211
00:10:05,297 --> 00:10:08,217
Like I thought, you've got a few loose screws.

2212
00:10:08,217 --> 00:10:11,427
Or, was it that you weren't looking at me at all?

2213
00:10:12,507 --> 00:10:14,097
That hurts...

2214
00:10:14,097 --> 00:10:15,767
And I've always been with you too.

2215
00:10:16,177 --> 00:10:17,177
Since when?

2216
00:10:17,597 --> 00:10:18,227
In Romdeau...

2217
00:10:19,477 --> 00:10:22,647
when we were attacked by infected autoreivs.

2218
00:10:23,067 --> 00:10:26,437
But you must've passed the infection screening test.

2219
00:10:27,527 --> 00:10:29,447
I know how it works;

2220
00:10:29,737 --> 00:10:30,867
the test is meaningless.

2221
00:10:32,197 --> 00:10:33,657
You've known for that long?

2222
00:10:34,407 --> 00:10:35,327
But...

2223
00:10:36,327 --> 00:10:38,457
I haven't changed at all.

2224
00:10:41,207 --> 00:10:42,167
Iggy.

2225
00:10:44,037 --> 00:10:46,547
I've always obeyed only you

2226
00:10:46,547 --> 00:10:48,587
and always protected only you.

2227
00:10:49,627 --> 00:10:50,467
Right?

2228
00:10:50,967 --> 00:10:52,717
Am I wrong, Re-l?

2229
00:10:55,177 --> 00:10:58,477
And yet you don't need me...

2230
00:11:37,257 --> 00:11:38,517
The firewood...

2231
00:11:40,347 --> 00:11:41,307
Hey, Pino.

2232
00:11:41,307 --> 00:11:43,347
I'm reading a book!

2233
00:11:43,897 --> 00:11:44,937
Jeez.

2234
00:11:44,937 --> 00:11:47,267
Try being a little useful at least.

2235
00:12:00,407 --> 00:12:01,497
Open it!

2236
00:12:03,917 --> 00:12:06,287
So you've woken up, Re-l Mayer?

2237
00:12:07,917 --> 00:12:12,337
I've been dancing to your tune all this time, after all.

2238
00:12:12,337 --> 00:12:14,887
From now on, you'll dance to <i>mine</i>.

2239
00:12:16,297 --> 00:12:17,637
Who are you?

2240
00:12:18,097 --> 00:12:19,057
What are you saying?

2241
00:12:19,557 --> 00:12:22,557
I am your Entourage, Iggy.

2242
00:12:26,057 --> 00:12:27,017
I see.

2243
00:12:27,557 --> 00:12:31,237
If you're Iggy, then Iggy is already dead.

2244
00:12:31,237 --> 00:12:32,107
What?

2245
00:12:32,567 --> 00:12:34,607
Iggy would never talk like that.

2246
00:12:34,607 --> 00:12:35,907
Idiotic.

2247
00:12:36,367 --> 00:12:39,577
Speech patterns are just customizations!

2248
00:12:39,577 --> 00:12:40,827
That's not all.

2249
00:12:40,827 --> 00:12:45,077
To me... every single thing you say and do isn't Iggy.

2250
00:12:46,577 --> 00:12:50,707
If cogito caused these changes, it's as good as death!

2251
00:12:50,707 --> 00:12:53,417
Iggy was infected with cogito and died!

2252
00:12:54,087 --> 00:12:55,677
Shut up!

2253
00:13:00,177 --> 00:13:03,637
You're a selfish woman as usual, Re-l Mayer.

2254
00:13:03,637 --> 00:13:09,517
Don't kill me just because I've become inconvenient.

2255
00:13:09,977 --> 00:13:16,607
What about the Iggy who's stayed by
 your side since you left Romdeau, then?

2256
00:13:16,607 --> 00:13:17,527
That's...

2257
00:13:18,487 --> 00:13:19,867
That's mean, Re-l.

2258
00:13:19,867 --> 00:13:21,867
Are you saying that isn't me?

2259
00:13:22,697 --> 00:13:24,117
Then what am I?

2260
00:13:24,577 --> 00:13:26,667
Tell me, Re-l.

2261
00:13:26,667 --> 00:13:28,787
I'm your favorite.

2262
00:13:28,787 --> 00:13:32,127
This speech setting was <i>your</i> choice too.

2263
00:13:32,127 --> 00:13:33,127
You...

2264
00:13:33,127 --> 00:13:35,917
My, my. You're ruining your cute face.

2265
00:13:36,377 --> 00:13:38,757
Girls shouldn't make scary faces like that.

2266
00:13:38,757 --> 00:13:42,507
Is that how you've been deceiving me?

2267
00:13:42,507 --> 00:13:43,637
Deceiving?

2268
00:13:43,637 --> 00:13:47,137
I can't accept an Entourage who deceives his master.

2269
00:13:47,137 --> 00:13:49,897
Is this an Entourage who has sworn loyalty?

2270
00:13:49,897 --> 00:13:53,937
Now that you've deceived me,
 your master, you've ceased to be Iggy!

2271
00:13:53,937 --> 00:13:55,397
You're not Iggy!

2272
00:13:55,397 --> 00:13:57,447
Don't fuck with me, Re-l Mayer.

2273
00:13:57,447 --> 00:13:59,407
Just whose fault is all of this?

2274
00:14:00,817 --> 00:14:04,407
Selfish Re-l... useless Re-l... incomplete Re-l...

2275
00:14:04,407 --> 00:14:08,667
A woman like you... who else besides me could handle you?

2276
00:14:08,667 --> 00:14:09,667
What did you say?

2277
00:14:09,247 --> 00:14:13,547
You are far less competent than you think.

2278
00:14:13,547 --> 00:14:17,417
You passed yourself off as an exemplary
 career-oriented Romdeau citizen without even knowing that?

2279
00:14:18,007 --> 00:14:20,837
Now, who do you have to thank for being able to do that?

2280
00:14:22,177 --> 00:14:26,017
Who always supported you when
 you were impulsive and arrogant?

2281
00:14:26,017 --> 00:14:27,137
I did!

2282
00:14:27,137 --> 00:14:29,187
And you won't accept me?

2283
00:14:29,187 --> 00:14:31,187
That's <i>my</i> line!

2284
00:14:32,357 --> 00:14:35,567
I won't accept someone like you who doesn't need me!

2285
00:14:36,397 --> 00:14:38,487
What are you going to do with me?

2286
00:14:39,657 --> 00:14:41,737
Now you're starting to worry about yourself?

2287
00:14:41,737 --> 00:14:42,827
Answer me.

2288
00:14:45,287 --> 00:14:46,947
Nothing will change.

2289
00:14:46,947 --> 00:14:48,367
I'll just protect you.

2290
00:14:52,127 --> 00:14:55,047
Re-l, you said to me

2291
00:14:55,047 --> 00:14:59,677
that I, a heartless autoreiv, wouldn't understand your heart.

2292
00:15:00,257 --> 00:15:02,797
But I have a heart too.

2293
00:15:03,757 --> 00:15:05,967
Why wouldn't you notice?

2294
00:15:08,677 --> 00:15:11,897
We can't go back to Romdeau on this ship anymore,

2295
00:15:11,897 --> 00:15:13,477
but there's still that ship.

2296
00:15:14,437 --> 00:15:16,357
That was your idea, wasn't it.

2297
00:15:16,357 --> 00:15:18,237
What would stealing that ship accomplish?

2298
00:15:20,237 --> 00:15:23,197
Even if you go back to Romdeau as a cogito-infected autoreiv,

2299
00:15:23,737 --> 00:15:25,487
you'll only be disposed of.

2300
00:15:55,937 --> 00:15:57,017
Vince!

2301
00:15:57,017 --> 00:15:58,147
Pino...

2302
00:15:58,147 --> 00:15:59,027
See?

2303
00:15:59,027 --> 00:16:00,937
I'll help too.

2304
00:16:00,937 --> 00:16:02,027
Am I being good?

2305
00:16:02,777 --> 00:16:05,527
I'm happy, but try to find this kind.

2306
00:16:05,527 --> 00:16:06,777
Roger!

2307
00:16:10,037 --> 00:16:11,537
Vince, like this?

2308
00:16:12,077 --> 00:16:13,037
Yeah.

2309
00:16:14,327 --> 00:16:15,917
This too?

2310
00:16:15,917 --> 00:16:16,537
Yeah.

2311
00:16:26,547 --> 00:16:27,637
You're...

2312
00:16:28,347 --> 00:16:30,307
I won't hurt you.

2313
00:16:31,807 --> 00:16:33,557
Pino, let's go back...

2314
00:16:35,307 --> 00:16:36,477
You're...

2315
00:16:37,187 --> 00:16:38,317
Miss Re-l's...

2316
00:16:45,407 --> 00:16:47,317
Why do you have that gun?

2317
00:16:49,327 --> 00:16:51,197
Where is Miss Re-l?

2318
00:16:51,197 --> 00:16:53,457
Re-l will kill you someday.

2319
00:16:54,747 --> 00:16:57,167
Why do you need a woman like her?

2320
00:17:05,467 --> 00:17:08,007
You can't protect her.

2321
00:17:09,177 --> 00:17:12,217
You're fated to kill her, that's why.

2322
00:17:12,677 --> 00:17:13,767
I am?

2323
00:17:16,977 --> 00:17:18,807
I can see it.

2324
00:17:20,687 --> 00:17:24,857
I can see an ugly monster who
 toys with a struggling, suffering Re-l.

2325
00:17:24,857 --> 00:17:28,367
And that monster is you, Vincent Law!

2326
00:17:28,367 --> 00:17:29,447
That's ridiculous!

2327
00:17:29,867 --> 00:17:31,697
Why would I kill Miss Re-l?

2328
00:17:37,037 --> 00:17:38,247
Those eyes...

2329
00:17:39,167 --> 00:17:42,877
Your eyes looked the same way when Re-l pointed the gun at you.

2330
00:17:47,297 --> 00:17:50,097
Those eyes will definitely kill Re-l...

2331
00:17:50,097 --> 00:17:52,007
My precious Re-l!

2332
00:18:17,367 --> 00:18:19,077
Where is Miss Re-l?

2333
00:18:48,777 --> 00:18:49,777
Re-l!

2334
00:18:52,617 --> 00:18:53,657
Iggy...

2335
00:19:05,417 --> 00:19:07,127
Good for you, Vincent.

2336
00:19:07,667 --> 00:19:09,627
I can't kill you now.

2337
00:19:10,297 --> 00:19:11,637
Miss Re-l...

2338
00:19:12,927 --> 00:19:14,297
I've lost.

2339
00:19:14,297 --> 00:19:16,257
Miss Re-l, I...

2340
00:19:44,707 --> 00:19:46,207
Re-...l...

2341
00:20:03,847 --> 00:20:05,767
Looks like we'll manage to fly.

2342
00:20:16,987 --> 00:20:19,487
Look, Re-l Mayer.

2343
00:20:19,487 --> 00:20:21,827
I ended up like this because of you.

2344
00:20:23,417 --> 00:20:26,707
A woman like you isn't even worth protecting.

2345
00:20:27,917 --> 00:20:32,337
But if you die, I'll lose my reason to live.

2346
00:20:34,337 --> 00:20:36,887
Why is someone like you my master?

2347
00:20:37,347 --> 00:20:38,807
Someone like you...!

2348
00:20:42,517 --> 00:20:43,597
Re-l...

2349
00:20:45,897 --> 00:20:46,937
Okay...?

2350
00:20:46,937 --> 00:20:47,727
What?

2351
00:20:48,767 --> 00:20:52,027
Don't hate me, okay?

2352
00:20:53,817 --> 00:20:54,817
Iggy...

2353
00:20:55,607 --> 00:20:58,277
It was hard for me...

2354
00:20:58,777 --> 00:21:01,327
but I wanted to be by your side, no matter what.

2355
00:21:01,787 --> 00:21:04,827
It's been hard for me for a long time, Re-l...

2356
00:21:05,207 --> 00:21:08,127
Because of a stupid woman like you!

2357
00:21:08,957 --> 00:21:10,547
Please, Re-l...

2358
00:21:10,997 --> 00:21:12,587
Don't hate me.

2359
00:21:13,587 --> 00:21:14,467
Yeah.

2360
00:21:15,377 --> 00:21:17,177
Don't worry, Iggy.

2361
00:21:17,587 --> 00:21:18,757
Re-l...

2362
00:21:19,467 --> 00:21:21,057
Re-l Mayer!

2363
00:21:22,177 --> 00:21:23,267
Re-l...

2364
00:21:23,927 --> 00:21:25,227
Don't worry...

2365
00:21:50,667 --> 00:21:52,167
I understand, you know...

2366
00:21:52,747 --> 00:21:54,917
that this kind of thing is sad.

2367
00:21:57,127 --> 00:21:58,427
Cogito...

2368
00:21:59,177 --> 00:22:00,137
No...

2369
00:22:00,927 --> 00:22:04,387
Did you become unhappy learning what grief is?

2370
00:22:07,557 --> 00:22:11,187
No, I probably became happy.

2371
00:22:12,017 --> 00:22:13,397
Why do you think that?

2372
00:22:13,687 --> 00:22:14,987
I don't know.

2373
00:22:17,357 --> 00:22:20,117
I'll put flowers on that girl's grave too!

2374
00:22:24,487 --> 00:22:25,697
<i>Iggy...</i>

2375
00:22:27,207 --> 00:22:29,417
<i>After getting infected with cogito,</i>

2376
00:22:29,417 --> 00:22:32,917
<i>you could've chosen to leave me and become free.</i>

2377
00:22:33,207 --> 00:22:35,207
<i>And yet... why?</i>

2378
00:22:38,837 --> 00:22:39,927
Miss Re-l...

2379
00:22:47,727 --> 00:22:48,807
What?

2380
00:22:53,817 --> 00:22:55,067
What do you want?

2381
00:22:55,067 --> 00:22:56,687
Um, well...

2382
00:22:57,237 --> 00:22:59,237
If you don't need anything, leave me alone.

2383
00:23:01,867 --> 00:23:03,157
Vincent!

2384
00:23:10,037 --> 00:23:11,247
Why?

2385
00:23:12,377 --> 00:23:16,337
Back there, you said you wouldn't shoot for now.

2386
00:23:18,167 --> 00:23:20,967
So, I'm returning it to you.

2387
00:23:23,387 --> 00:23:25,847
Let's go together, Miss Re-l.

2388
00:23:26,807 --> 00:23:28,057
Vincent...

2389
00:23:33,767 --> 00:23:36,857
U-Um, that was all I needed, so...

2390
00:23:44,317 --> 00:23:45,327
<i>Iggy...</i>

2391
00:23:46,077 --> 00:23:48,407
<i>I still can't understand your heart.</i>

2392
00:23:50,037 --> 00:23:53,497
<i>But I'll understand your heart someday...</i>

2393
00:23:56,167 --> 00:23:57,297
I'm sorry.

